# Bulk data and reference material live on disk but stay out of git.
# input/ holds multi-GB extracts (one is 2.4 GB); git and GitHub cannot carry them.
input/*
# The one extract already committed on 2026-09-13 stays tracked.
!input/case_nov_MASTER_SOURCE_CITYWIDE_LLT_THRU_20251231_ENRICHED_01272026__PLUS_RECORDLIST-RARE.csv

# Reference dumps (old site builds, bundled R.A.R.E. site, brand assets) — ~6.4 GB
_REFERENCE/

# Drop zone: contents are unsorted until they are moved somewhere real
_INBOX/*
!_INBOX/README.md

# District maps build: the source extracts are bulk data (the building outlines alone are 104 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB limit).
# Only the small district outline file is tracked. Backups, the duplicate test build and the upload zip stay on disk.
site/_district_maps_build/source/*
!site/_district_maps_build/source/seattle_council_districts_CURRENT.geojson
site/_district_maps_build/_backup_*/
site/_district_maps_build/pages_buildings/
site/_district_maps_build/*.zip
# Internal notes with local folder paths stay off the public repo.
site/_district_maps_build/*TRANSFER_DOC*.md
site/_district_maps_build/*SOURCE_INDEX*.json

__pycache__/
desktop.ini
.~lock*
